n</g>\n</svg></span> is the trend line of the scatter plot above?</p>\n\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <p>The plot shows that the data points are scattered along a curve, not a straight line.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-0e32e7767c5353f75f4d693d454192a4\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/0e32e7767c5353f75f4d693d454192a4\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, there is no linear trend in the data.</p>\n\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
